+ *                                  0xd0 polygon it is the area pattern,
+ *                                  repeated and masked by the polygon
  *   0xb2, 0xb4-0xb7, others        skipped up to the next command word
  *
  * Render target: reg 0x50 (address), reg 0x5c (stride in pixels).
